  "description": "NO LONGER MAINTAINED. The source repository (github.com/microbiomedata/nmdc-ontology) has been archived and this BioPortal entry is not updated. NMDC no longer publishes a standalone ontology; it loads external ontologies into its data infrastructure (NMDC MongoDB, used by nmdc-server). The NMDC Ontology (NMDCO) is used by the National Microbiome Data Collaborative (NMDC, https://microbiomedata.org) to annotate multi-omic microbiome metadata. It merges a number of ontologies relevant to the NMDC (such as the plant and environment ontologies) into a single ontology.\r\nThe ontology can be download from Github at https://github.com/microbiomedata/nmdc-ontology.",
